## 10. SMART NOTES

Smart Notes are structured units of useful learning.

Supported note classes include:

- insight
- lesson
- breakthrough
- decision
- mistake
- question
- goal
- opportunity
- discovery
- wisdom

A Smart Note should carry provenance and scope sufficient to distinguish:

- who created it
- where it came from
- whether it is private
- whether it is shared
- what permission governs sharing
- what intelligence system may use it

A Smart Note is not automatically collective knowledge.

