## 29. ARCHITECTURAL TEST

A feature is not complete because the UI looks right.

It is complete when:

**UI → authorization → service → data boundary → result → audit/verification**

all agree.

For every sensitive operation, ask:

> **Can the server enforce this rule even if the client is malicious?**

If not, the architecture is incomplete.

